name: Read finding groups with an operator label and no model work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_supporting_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART initial
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: run findings:groups {}
require-live-snap: 30 Show finding groups: | completed-groups
expect: member decisions remain independent
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_supporting_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART group-result
ask: Does the completion notice explain the group query while keeping individual finding decisions, authority and proof distinct?
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 TP: 1 | unchanged-report
expect: Reviewed and TP totals include human and automatic decisions.
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
